      <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/idcidc\">idcidc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 11:56:46 +08:00\">22h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>plus 定位本来就是轻度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18027208\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/879e/7e00/496618_normal.png?m=1786610342\" alt=\"yihy8023\" data-uid=\"496618\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yihy8023\">yihy8023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 12:05:34 +08:00\">22h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>换了 luna max ，耐用了好多。🥹</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18027222\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9f9f47246fb5e0cde72ff1c879e629c6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kenvix\" data-uid=\"89136\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kenvix\">kenvix</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 12:11:38 +08:00\">22h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>O 畜特色不得不品</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18027255\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3baa/a944/800854_normal.png?m=1779784301\" alt=\"lel020\" data-uid=\"800854\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lel020\">lel020</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 12:23:31 +08:00\">22h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最近上了 claude pro ，是真的觉得 codex plus 额度少的离谱，好几倍的差距，<br>哪怕算上封号成本，我两个 claude 已经封了一个，现在开第三个，plus 已经取消了，下个月就不用了，</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18027616\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2701/ecad/352047_normal.png?m=1776995669\" alt=\"JZen\" data-uid=\"352047\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JZen\">JZen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 14:17:31 +08:00\">20h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5h 用量一直都是周用量的 1/7 左右，和以前差不多。自从 4 月 2 日改了计费规则之后，plus 基本就废了。以前 5h 用量能跑一个小时的任务，后面同样的任务 10 分钟就把 5h 跑完了。但现在有 luna 模型，我感觉 plus 又有性价比了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18027643\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6ca/4972/312242_normal.png?m=1780449117\" alt=\"Sezxy\" data-uid=\"312242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sezxy\">Sezxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 14:22:42 +08:00\">20h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>耗光 5h ，周限剩余 84%</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18028034\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dbf0/f1ab/504831_normal.png?m=1777999188\" alt=\"AEDaydreamer\" data-uid=\"504831\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AEDaydreamer\">AEDaydreamer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 15:36:27 +08:00\">19h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>主要是 5h 太影响节奏, 工作都是一段一段的,正遇上事就卡住了.<br>我从 5x 回退到 plus 用起来真的难受.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18028041\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f61420767d3d2dfaa388a8077ba2929f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Lockroach\" data-uid=\"669810\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Lockroach\">Lockroach</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 15:38:48 +08:00\">18h 59m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>是很少，所以现在都用 sol high 做规划，实施交给 luna 或者 ds</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18028048\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b349/a1af/415096_normal.png?m=1618586856\" alt=\"lujiaosama\" data-uid=\"415096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lujiaosama\">lujiaosama</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 15:39:46 +08:00\">18h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还记得半年前大家的口径是 CODEX 耐用额度多，现在怎么变成这个鬼样子了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18028487\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/127c01c2f36cd4ce3ca9afc2502f9198?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"prosgtsr\" data-uid=\"649369\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/prosgtsr\">prosgtsr</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 17:06:50 +08:00\">17h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/JZen\">JZen</a> 我记得大概半年前，我连续 2 次用完 5h 限额，给我自己搞得筋疲力竭了。周限额用了大半。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18028495\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/127c01c2f36cd4ce3ca9afc2502f9198?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"prosgtsr\" data-uid=\"649369\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/prosgtsr\">prosgtsr</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 17:09:04 +08:00\">17h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/AEDaydreamer\">AEDaydreamer</a> 我用了一会儿，还剩 38%，21：04 结束。<br>心里开始焦虑了。<br>而且这么一算，16:04 开始这次 5h ，也就是我才用了 64 分钟，已经花了 62%了。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18028503\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/127c01c2f36cd4ce3ca9afc2502f9198?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"prosgtsr\" data-uid=\"649369\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/prosgtsr\">prosgtsr</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 17:10:57 +08:00\">17h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yihy8023\">yihy8023</a> 前几天找 ai 计算，同样的任务，luna max 应该比 sol high 多 20 倍 token ，那恐怕我是猛踩都踩不完。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18028513\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/127c01c2f36cd4ce3ca9afc2502f9198?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"prosgtsr\" data-uid=\"649369\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/prosgtsr\">prosgtsr</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 17:12:24 +08:00\">17h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lujiaosama\">lujiaosama</a> 实际上现在 plus 的周限额对我来说也够用，我不是每天都高强度使用。只会用个几天，特别是周末几乎不用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18028706\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af3d/c7ac/212115_normal.png?m=1785390089\" alt=\"m0mo\" data-uid=\"212115\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/m0mo\">m0mo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 17:57:04 +08:00\">16h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在由于 SOL 的消耗 token 太多，加上一个任务没跑完但限额到了不能继续跑了，导致 PLUS 基本不可用高级模型了。加上最近降智严重加速度极慢，我已经不考虑续了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029155\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7e06/1cec/743039_normal.png?m=1787929036\" alt=\"jijicc\" data-uid=\"743039\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jijicc\">jijicc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-28 23:37:50 +08:00\">11h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>白嫖越来越难了看来</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029203\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7d55bae99016b05cd1cb7224d7ed63a8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhangbird\" data-uid=\"744882\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhangbird\">zhangbird</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 00:43:40 +08:00\">9h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5h 用的是真快啊，刚让 ai 帮我实现一个功能跑一下之后就没了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18029345\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c2cb840e1682930b41c58520b5836c22?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cellsyx\" data-uid=\"604584\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cellsyx\">cellsyx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-29 08:44:29 +08:00\">1h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lujiaosama\">lujiaosama</a